i. provide for education and scholarship in such branches of knowledge as it maydeem fit, and to make provision for research, service to society and for theapplication, advancement and dissemination of knowledge in such manner as itmay determine. Provided that the Board shall be competent to approve facultiesand departnents on the reoommendation of Academic Council as it maydetermine, subject to the approval of the relevant statutory body of aprofessional education, where applicable. Make provisions for the virtual anddistanoe leaming educational programs;ii. prescribe courses of studies to be conducted by it and the constituentcolleges/institutes;iii. offer joint degree programs in collaboration with national and intemationaluniversities and educational institutions subject to prior approval of theCommission;iv. establish programs for the exchange of students and teachers between theInstitute and other universities, educational institutions and researchorganization, inside as well as outside Pakistan;v. aieptthe examinations passed and the period of study spent by students of theInstiiute at other universities and places of leaming equivalent to suchexaminations and periods of study in the Institute, as it may prescribe, and towithdraw such acceptance;vi. establish, maintain and administer deparhnents, constituent colleges, constituentinstitutes, centers of excellence, laboratories, workshops, officesand other facilities for the development of teaching and research andtechnological development as the Board may, on the recommendation ofAcademic Council, determine;vii. make provisions for teaching, training, research, service to community and forthe application, advancement and dissemination of knowledge in such manneras it may determine;viii. decide teaching methods and strategies to provide for effective educationaland training programs;ix. hold- examinations in the prescribed manner and, if a person qualifies theexamination, award degree, diplomq certificate and other academic distinctionto the person;x. provide for such instruotion for persons not being students of the Institute as itmay prescribe, and to grant certificates and diplomas to such persons;Page 3 of 23

