29. e rese tatio Co ittees.-(l) There shall be a Representation Committeeconstituted by the Board of Govemors through Statute for recommendation of persons forappointnent to the Board of Govemors in accordance with the provisions of section 24.
(2) There shall also be a Representation Committee constituted by the Board of Governorsthrough Statute for the recommendation of persons for appointment to the ExecutiveCommittee and the Academic Council in accordance with the provisions of sections2T and28.(3) Members of the Representation Committee for appointnents to the Board ofGovernors shall consist of the following:-(a) three members of the Board of Governors who are not Institute Teachers;(b) two persons nominated by the Institute Teachers from amongst themselves in themanner prescribed;(c) one person from the academic community, not employed by the Institute, at thelevel of professor or college principal to be nominated by the Institute Teachers inPage 14 of 23

