52. ort ni to s ow ca se.-Except as otherwise provided by lawno officer, teacher or other employee of the Institute holding a pernanent post shall bereduced in rank, or removed or compulsorily retired from service for cause arising out of anyact or omission on the part ofthe person concerned unless he has been given a reasonableopportunity of showing cause against the action proposed to be taken.
